  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "英文寫作",
    "sub_ename": "ENGLISH WRITING",
    "describe_ch": "This course is designed to help students compose great essays. By focusing on various styles of writing, we offer a wide range of support to improve your skills in a multitude of genres, including discursive, analytical, and narrative works, which are essential to all academics and professionals. \r\n\r\nThrough the proper use of these skills, students will be able to organize and write very cohesively, paying particular attention to the following five criteria:  thesis/focus, organization, content/development, syntax/diction, and mechanics/grammar.  \r\n\r\nThroughout the course, students must write at least three essays, each of which the instructor shall grade with both written comments and verbal feedback.\r\n\r\nThe design of this course shall enhance your writing capability to a standard that should match all college students at home and abroad. The core skills gained herein will solidify your future progress both in academia and in other professions.\r\n",
    "describe_eh": "This course is designed to help students compose great essays. By focusing on various styles of writing, we offer a wide range of support to improve your skills in a multitude of genres, including discursive, analytical, and narrative works, which are essential to all academics and professionals. \r\n\r\nThrough the proper use of these skills, students will be able to organize and write very cohesively, paying particular attention to the following five criteria:  thesis/focus, organization, content/development, syntax/diction, and mechanics/grammar.  \r\n\r\nThroughout the course, students must write at least three essays, each of which the instructor shall grade with both written comments and verbal feedback.\r\n\r\nThe design of this course shall enhance your writing capability to a standard that should match all college students at home and abroad. The core skills gained herein will solidify your future progress both in academia and in other professions.\r\n\r\n",
